  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Historical dataset of Address points in Detroit, Michigan as of 2026. Address locations represent the center point of related physical objects. When an address is related to a building or a unit in a building, its point location is the center point of the related building. When an address is related to a parcel, its location is the center point of the related parcel. The Addresses dataset was created and is updated by the Department of Public Works Maps & Records Division and the Department of Innovation and Technology (DoIT)."
